SUMMARY:Moving to Heylo
DESCRIPTION:Go Wild Hikers\nHello Hikers\,\nIf you've enjoyed hiking with 
 this group\, follow me as I move Go Wild Hikers to a new platform by the e
 nd of May. This is not the end but the beginning of a different trail for 
 Go Wild Hikers. It's people like you that have made this group so great!! 
 Thank you all for being members of Go Wild Hikers and I appreciate the lar
 ge number of Hikers who have already followed the group to Heylo. The Shil
 oh Hike on Sunday May 31 is nearly full.\n**I will continue to post a new 
 hike on Heylo every Friday.**\n**Upcoming events for Go Wild Hikers in Jun
 e will include Hood Mtn\, Taylor Mtn\, Annadel and North Sonoma Mtn to Jac
 k London.**\n[https://heylo.com/invite/PpURbZWX](http://clicks.meetup.com/
